    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\n“Interested in this property? Sign up for mySherryFitz to arrange your viewing, see current offers, or make your own offer. Register now at SherryFitz.ie.\n\nSherry FitzGerald Draper are delighted to present this well located spacious two bedroom ground floor own door apartment to the market.\nUnique opportunity to acquire this dual aspect apartment situated within this small select development in walking distance to Sligo city centre.\nLocated on the outskirts of Sligo city on the Rosses Point Road with great amenities nearby including convenience store, bus stop, pub etc.\nInternally the well-proportioned accommodation includes own door entrance porch & hallway, kitchen / dining / living room with extensive range of fitted kitchen units & sliding door to a sunny west facing patio, two sizeable bedrooms (one ensuite) and a well-equipped house bathroom. \nTo the rear there is a semi private west facing patio & a communal garden that links well with the apartment through a sliding door & it also has the benefit of surface off street car parking to the front.\nThe ever-popular seaside village of Rosses Point is only a short drive away with a regular bus service outside the door.\n\nViewing highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nPorch - 1.93m x 1.18m\n\n\nHallway - 6.9m x 1.17m\nlarge shelved hotpress and separate open store\n\nLiving / Dining / Kitchen - 7.22m x 5.57m\nExtensive range of wall and floor units, wooden flooring,Patio door to semi private rear patio & garden\n\nBedroom 1 - 4.79m x 3.59m\nnewly carpeted flooring\n\nEnsuite - 2.44m x 1m\nshower, wc, whb, wall and floor tiling\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.35m x 2.47m\n\n\nBathroom - 2.56m x w.55m\nbath, wc, whb, wall and floor tiling\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Electric heating</li><li>Double glazed timber sash windows</li><li>Own door</li><li>Car parking on site</li><li>Good amenities nearby including a convenience store & bus stop outside the door with regular service to both Sligo town centre & Rosses Point seaside village</ul>"
      },
